I left out the two operations requests. The node's `with` clause grants only `wasi:clocks/wall-clock@0.2.0`, so it has no file-write or HTTP authority. Adding either import would break the capability contract. The code below reads only the clock.

```wit
package gen:node;

world node {
    use aap:caps/types@0.1.0.{tick, run-info};

    import wasi:clocks/wall-clock@0.2.0;

    export run: func(tick: tick) -> run-info;
}
```

